  "limitations": [
    "Sixteen repeatedly inspected development photographs; the policy was motivated by earlier results on these cases. No unseen generalization claim.",
    "Fourteen unchanged crop selections intentionally share one production fit. This prevents timing variation from confounding the policy comparison; it is not repeated-trial timing evidence.",
    "Automated checks compare against classified photographic masks. Some checked pairs still look visibly imperfect; original cutting artwork is unavailable.",
    "Two evaluation checkpoints, not one trained production model. Models remain outside the website.",
    "Strict prior WASM probability tolerance remains failed; the threshold was not relaxed. Full-photo browser preprocessing is still untested."
  ],
